WEATHER CHATBOT - COMENZI IN ORDINE (PowerShell)

Se folosesc 2 terminale PowerShell.


=== INSTALARE (doar prima data) ===

Terminal 1:

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot"
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
copy .env.example .env

Terminal 2:

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot\frontend"
npm install


=== PORNIRE (de fiecare data) ===

Terminal 1 (backend):

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot"
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
cd backend
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

Terminal 2 (frontend):

cd "D:\Visual Studio\Laborator SOPM\weather-chatbot\frontend"
npm run dev

Deschide in browser: http://localhost:5173


=== OPRIRE ===

Ctrl + C in fiecare terminal.


=== OPTIONAL: AI (Claude) ===

1. Pune cheia in backend\.env:  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=cheia_ta
2. Reporneste backend-ul.
Fara cheie, chatbotul merge in mod simplu (fara AI).


=== DACA APAR ERORI ===

- "running scripts is disabled" la Activate.ps1:
  Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned

- "python not found": instaleaza Python de pe python.org
  (bifeaza "Add python.exe to PATH"), apoi deschide un terminal nou.

- "Nu mă pot conecta la server" in chat: backend-ul nu ruleaza (Terminal 1).